messages.content:
Good.
Now we add minimal working content.
1️⃣ Button component
Open:
projects/dev-project/app/components/Button.tsx
Paste:
export default function Button({ label }: { label: string }) {
  return (
    <button
      style={{
        padding: "8px 12px",
        borderRadius: 6,
        border: "1px solid #333",
        cursor: "pointer"
      }}
    >
      {label}
    </button>
  );
}

2️⃣ Page file
Open:
projects/dev-project/app/page.tsx
Paste:
import Button from "./components/Button";

export default function Page() {
  return (
    <div style={{ padding: 40 }}>
      <h1>Hello from Builder</h1>
      <Button label="Click me" />
    </div>
  );
}

3️⃣ Leave globals.css empty for now
Do not import CSS.

Now restart clean:
pkill -f next || true
rm -rf .next
npm run dev
Then test:
curl "http://localhost:3000/api/dev/preview/bundle?projectId=dev-project" | head
If no build error appears, open the Builder preview.
Report exactly what you see. No interpretation. Just result.
